# DuplexSoft — product-aware UI

- This repo is the **institutional marketing site** for DuplexSoft (`www.duplexsoft.com.br`), not the operational app (`app.duplexsoft.com.br`).
- **Canonical context:** `PRODUCT.md` (product) and `DESIGN.md` (visual system). Legacy mirrors: `product-design-brief.md`, `docs/design-system.md` — do not let them diverge.
- Optimize for brand credibility, regional trust (Uberaba / Triângulo Mineiro), clear storytelling (DX Web + WebPosto), and conversion (contato, WhatsApp, chat, acesso ao app).
- Prefer editing content via `src/lib/site.ts` (`siteConfig`, `solutions`) over scattering copy.
- Preserve brand tokens in `src/app/globals.css` and `DESIGN.md`. Do not replace with generic AI palettes.
- Do not present DropDesk in the product showcase unless `PRODUCT.md` is updated.
- Reuse `Header`, `Footer`, `BrandLogo`/`BrandMark`, `ContactForm`, `SolutionPreview`, and shell classes (`.site-shell`, `.display-font`, `.hero-stage`, `.surface-panel`).
- **Visual craft / polish / AI-slop detection:** prefer Impeccable (`/impeccable …`). **Product UX / IA / handoff:** `ui-ux-designer`. **Implementation:** `senior-frontend-engineer`. **Independent rendered review:** `visual-reviewer`. **A11y deep-dive:** `accessibility-reviewer`.
- Scale process to task size: a one-line fix does not need full discovery + critique + audit.
- If a decision materially affects brand or conversion and cannot be inferred, ask one focused question; otherwise document an explicit assumption.
- Respond and write UI copy in Portuguese (pt-BR) unless the user asks otherwise.
